        "text": "Earned wage access has come a long way since the payroll headache it once was.\n\nI’m excited to partner with PayrollOrg (formerly the American Payroll Association and GPMI) for an upcoming webinar with Kira Rubiano, Partner at Payrollminds, to discuss what payroll-first EWA looks like today, and why it’s becoming easier than ever to implement and manage.\n\nWe’ll also share new PayrollOrg survey findings and practical guidance for evaluating solutions, whether you’re considering EWA for the first time or replacing a legacy solution.\n\nExcited to represent Chime Workplace. Hope you’ll join us.\n\n📅 August 6 | 1:00 PM EDT\n\nRegister here: https://bit.ly/4fpcBde",
