        "text": "Bringing the right people together at the right moment is what great partnerships are all about.\n\nDallas was one of those moments, where we could connect CHROs and senior leaders for a real conversation on how AI is reshaping the workforce — and what it will take to lead through it.\n\nAppreciate the perspectives shared and the strength of the network we’re continuing to build in this space.",
