        "text": "For years, speed of access defined earned wage access.\n\nBut according to new Everest Group research, employers are asking more fundamental questions:\n\n\n Does the program actually improve employee financial wellness?\n Does it provide insight beyond transactions into employee financial progress?\n Does it integrate cleanly without charging employees fees?\n\nAccess alone is no longer the bar.\n\nJoin Jason Leeand Sharath Hari N for a live discussion on what this shift means for HR, payroll, and benefits leaders hosted by HR Executive.\n\n Thursday, February 19, 2026\n 1:00 PM ET | 60 minutes\n\n Register here: \nhttps://hubs.ly/Q042W7sr0\n\n\n#EarnedWageAccess #FinancialWellness #HRtech #FinancialHealth #ChimeWorkplace",
